# .gitleaksignore
#
# Known false positives, each one checked by hand before it was added here.
#
# Every entry below points at the tests of the secret-shaped-literal gate. A gate
# that detects credentials has to ship fake credentials in its tests, otherwise
# nothing proves that it works.
#
# Test files are NOT excluded by path: a real secret inside a fixture must still
# block the commit. That is why the test lines below are listed one at a time.
#
# The fingerprint includes the line number: if the file changes and a line moves,
# the finding comes back and has to be reviewed again. That is deliberate: noise
# is better than blindness.
#
# A new fingerprint goes in here only after checking that it is not a real secret.
# For a real key, the answer is not this file: rotate the key.

